Package: metube
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Recommends: aria2
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Moechz/metube
Description: Web GUI for yt-dlp with playlist support
 MeTube is a web GUI for yt-dlp, supporting playlists and quality/format
 selection. This package is self-contained: it bundles a private CPython
 3.13 runtime, all Python dependencies (pinned via uv.lock), a Deno
 runtime and the bgutil POT provider for YouTube.
 .
 Web UI listens on port 8081 by default. Configuration lives in
 /etc/metube/metube.env. No default download directory is preset:
 set one via DOWNLOAD_DIR there, or type any absolute path into the
 web UI Download Folder field.
